ixed layer hierarchy and framing. The card maps","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" Position to its offset. Release projects momentum, applies the Drag","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch’s rubber-band bounds, and pulses Reset when both position axes are within the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placed graph’s 100-point center tolerance.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"}}}